---
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
---
<Diagram caption={"One request, two tiers. The caller never needs to know which rows are hot and which are archived; at most 31 archive files are opened per request, so follow next until it is null."}>
<svg viewBox="0 0 960 490" role="img" aria-labelledby="read-t read-d" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<title id="read-t">Read path across tiers</title>
<desc id="read-d">A client asks for rows from a table. The gateway reads recent rows from PostgreSQL, finds the archive files overlapping the time range, downloads and verifies them if they are not in the local cache, queries them with DuckDB, merges both result sets in order, and returns a page with a cursor.</desc>
<defs>
<marker id="read-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-fill"/></marker>
<marker id="read-ac" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" class="arrow-accent"/></marker>
</defs>
<rect x="20" y="150" width="150" height="80" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="95" y="186" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Client</text><text x="95" y="204" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">GET /tables/&#123;t&#125;/rows</text><rect x="300" y="90" width="260" height="250" rx="10" class="box-accent"/><text x="430" y="116" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Gateway</text><rect x="320" y="134" width="220" height="50" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="430" y="155" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Check filters</text><text x="430" y="173" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">types, operators, range</text><rect x="320" y="198" width="220" height="50" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="430" y="219" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">DuckDB over files</text><text x="430" y="237" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">same filters, verified Parquet</text><rect x="320" y="262" width="220" height="50" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="430" y="283" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Merge</text><text x="430" y="301" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">order by (created_at, object_id)</text><rect x="740" y="40" width="200" height="90" rx="8" class="box-hot"/><text x="840" y="72" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">PostgreSQL</text><text x="840" y="90" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">hot rows,</text><text x="840" y="108" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">created_at index</text><rect x="610" y="300" width="110" height="70" rx="8" class="box"/><text x="665" y="331" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Disk cache</text><text x="665" y="349" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">by SHA-256</text><rect x="770" y="300" width="170" height="70" rx="8" class="box-cold"/><text x="855" y="331" class="t-b" text-anchor="middle">Bucket</text><text x="855" y="349" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">archive/ files</text><polyline points="170,190 300,190" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#read-ac)"/><circle cx="235" cy="175" r="10" class="dot"/><text x="235" y="179" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--d-box);font-weight:700;font-size:12px">1</text><polyline points="560,150 740,90" class="edge" marker-end="url(#read-a)"/><circle cx="650" cy="105" r="10" class="dot"/><text x="650" y="109" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--d-box);font-weight:700;font-size:12px">2</text><text x="650" y="82" class="t-muted" text-anchor="middle">recent days</text><polyline points="560,330 610,335" class="edge" marker-end="url(#read-a)" marker-start="url(#read-a)"/><circle cx="585" cy="316" r="10" class="dot"/><text x="585" y="320" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--d-box);font-weight:700;font-size:12px">3</text><polyline points="720,335 770,335" class="edge" marker-end="url(#read-a)"/><circle cx="745" cy="316" r="10" class="dot"/><text x="745" y="320" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--d-box);font-weight:700;font-size:12px">4</text><polyline points="300,290 170,215" class="edge-accent" marker-end="url(#read-ac)"/><circle cx="235" cy="262" r="10" class="dot"/><text x="235" y="266" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--d-box);font-weight:700;font-size:12px">6</text><text x="20" y="330" class="t-h" text-anchor="start">WHAT HAPPENS</text><text x="20" y="352" class="t" text-anchor="start">1  Request with filters and a time range</text><text x="20" y="370" class="t" text-anchor="start">2  Hot rows come from PostgreSQL</text><text x="20" y="388" class="t" text-anchor="start">3  Archive files for the range are listed</text><text x="20" y="406" class="t" text-anchor="start">    (hours outside it are never opened)</text><text x="20" y="424" class="t" text-anchor="start">4  On a cache miss: download, verify size + SHA-256</text><text x="20" y="442" class="t" text-anchor="start">5  DuckDB applies the filters to the files</text><text x="20" y="460" class="t" text-anchor="start">6  Merged page: items + next cursor</text>
</svg>
</Diagram>
